# Invalid chip ID rejection
name: invalid-chip-id
version: 1
description: Empty or overlong chip IDs are rejected with REJECTED_INVALID.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read ""
assert last_result REJECTED_INVALID
expect_read AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA REJECTED_INVALID
read CHIP-001
assert last_result RECORDED
assert observations 1